(7564670, 1213477, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love these little guys. Incredibly human ears.  Just seems oversharpened to overcome a focus issue.</td>', 'I love these little guys. Incredibly human ears.  Just seems oversharpened to overcome a focus issue.', '2018-04-02 22:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
